	measure '_Scope 1&2_ Reporting Year' = ```
			
			
			VAR _yearText =
			    FORMAT ( SELECTEDVALUE ( 'CORP_GHG DTbl_Scope1&2'[Year] ), "0" )  -- 2019 -> "2019"
			RETURN
			IF (
			    NOT ISBLANK ( _yearText ),
			    CALCULATE (
			        SUM ( 'CORP_GHG DTbl_Scope1&2'[Value] ),
			        /* Fixed filters pushed into the measure (no filter pane needed) */
			        KEEPFILTERS ( 'CORP_GHG DTbl_Scope1&2'[Scope] = "Scope 1+2" ),
			        /* Exclude blanks/empty strings in label first */
			        KEEPFILTERS (
			            'CORP_GHG DTbl_Scope1&2'[Reporting Year Label/Filter] <> BLANK()
			            && 'CORP_GHG DTbl_Scope1&2'[Reporting Year Label/Filter] <> ""
			        ),
			        /* Then match the selected year text */
			        KEEPFILTERS ( 'CORP_GHG DTbl_Scope1&2'[Reporting Year Label/Filter] = _yearText ),
			        /* Keep only non-target rows if Is Target Filter is a column (0/1) */
			        KEEPFILTERS ( 'CORP_GHG DTbl_Scope1&2'[Is Target Filter] = 0 )
			       ))
			
			```
		lineageTag: fdb3efa9-36f8-4d8c-8786-0ab4bc54c590

